      "message": "Thanks Narayana for the background.\n\n@lajos@google.com please correct me if I\u0027m wrong, but my understanding is that as there\u0027s no formal profile and level system for VP8 the codec should be able to handle receiving LEVEL_UNUSED/PROFILE_UNUSED, and the mapping could be done in the codec.",
