      "writtenOn": "2026-10-17T00:27:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing this out. This lines up with my comment that these are really profiles equivalents - but unfortunately I capitulated in aosp/1679426 as I still think this is better captured as complexity.\n\nHowever, if we already added profiles, we do not need levels. Instead the mapper needs to map to the correct C2 profile based on the VP8 levels - as MediaCodec API treats these as levels.\n\nThat said, I am tempted to mark those profile definitions as deprecated and pursue the complexity approach to be consistent in our profile/level handling.",
